{"id": "DeAGLRaPASd", "title": "Video by mrliamrobins", "description": "How to set it up ⬇️\n\nStep 1: Use Amplify and Claude to find AI tools and free resources people don’t know about yet.\n\nStep 2: Make an Instagram video breaking down why that tool beats what your audience uses now.\n\nStep 3: Set up ManyChat. Tell people to comment a keyword and the free resource lands in their DMs.\n\nStep 4: 24 hours later, send the same people a long-form YouTube video showing how to use the resource properly.\n\nStep 5: 24 hours after that, send a link to your Skool community. Free tier first. Paid tier for people who want to turn the tool into revenue.\n\nRun this playbook for a year. The following comes first. The revenue follows.\n\nFollow @mrliamrobins for more daily breakdowns", "channel": "mrliamrobins", "uploader_id": "79625316898", "uploader": "Liam Robins", "timestamp": 1790964676, "like_count": 564, "comment_count": 13, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2573486756457902a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 59.078, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNTjKipO9-lakyOupPbovhB8PcaiAAKxCCOiynwvcdd4RXDtNW3FrgjktrmV9fbFCsrYBDtMOinJpaAqOEf0f8ROr0EX2pF-HMqXGs.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=TB_a-CbOKr4Q7kNvwFfFC2M&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=OOZg_8f1Vodi0qrDXzvORA&_nc_ss=7ba8c&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQNybbBHF9Z42EiF4z9uxCC6UzYvztkPdIs4jKEkMIJPug&oe=6AC9C3E0", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 59.078